<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NATAL 288-5 IN 55 OVERS V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATAL 288-5 IN 55 OVERS V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal scored 288-5 from 55 overs in their one-day match against India at Kingsmead on Monday.</p>
